    "summary": "Added paid-only `anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5` with a 1M-token context window, text and image input, tool calling, and adaptive reasoning. Its primary route uses AWS Bedrock profile `global.anthropic.claude-haiku-5-5` with a 128K-token output limit; sampling parameters are omitted. A hidden Vercel AI Gateway route provides fallback under the same model ID and inherits the primary route’s pricing tiers. Billing is per million input, output, cache-read, and five-minute cache-write tokens; when a prompt exceeds 100K tokens, the long-context tier applies to the whole request. The `claude-haiku` and `claude-fast` aliases remain on Haiku 4.5.",
